}

R --> UC001
R --> UC002
R --> UC003
R --> UC004
R --> UC005
CI --> UC003

UC002 ..> UC001 : <<include>>
UC003 ..> UC001 : <<include>>
UC004 ..> UC003 : <<include>>
UC005 ..> UC004 : <<include>>

note right of UC001 : FR-001 · Status: Implemented
note right of UC002 : FR-002 · H-006 · Status: Implemented
note right of UC003 : FR-003, FR-006 · NFR-001..005 · C-003, C-005 · Status: Implemented
note right of UC004 : FR-004 · H-001, H-002 · Status: Implemented
note right of UC005 : FR-005 · H-001..H-006 · Status: Implemented
@enduml
